{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827207818117144","content":"Web sits on the edge of the cliff and gazes out. \"Didn't think would ever have to do this. Thought life in new world would be simpler. Make things easier. Maybe yesterday Web would've dragged this out, apologizing. But wardens helped. Have forgiven myself. But this not about wrong things in the past. This about making a better future.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T07:01:51.853000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745900393011085333","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827207818117144","content":"||They pull out a small stone knife and grit their teeth. They make a series of slow cuts on various parts of their body. One down the back of each arm, one along the length of their nose and up their forehead, and one from each ear to the side of their mouth. They take off their cloak and binder, and make a few druidic markings on their torso, shoulders, and legs. They spread their limbs out. \"Now.\" Many spiders begin to scurry all over their body, drinking the blood flowing out of their wounds. They remain this way for a while.||","created_at":"2020-08-20T07:12:45.289000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-20T07:15:25.134000Z","id":"745903133720313926","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827207818117144","content":"||When the process has finished, they rub a salve on the affected parts of their body that is designed to stop bleeding but promote scarification. They put their cloak and binder back on, the only signs of their ritual the quickly forming scars on their face. ||","created_at":"2020-08-20T07:15:48.321000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745903901412163616","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827207818117144","content":"They look to the assembled spiders and speak in a ritualistic tone. \"Now I am a part of you, just as you are a part of me. We are together as one, that we may never be apart. I give this gift to you as an act of farewell. May you spread our stories far and wide, may your memories and actions speak of our traditions, and your thoughts be ever of me and mine.\" Web opens the pouch and pulls out small sacks of webbing. They fasten each one to a spider. They raise their hands and cast *Wind Wall* next to them, manipulating the flow of air to be strong towards the mainland. \"Fare well, loyal scions.\" Web says, pointing their hands off the edge.","created_at":"2020-08-20T07:24:02.164000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745905972739964929","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827207818117144","content":"The equipped spiders scurry off the edge of Web's hands, and their silk parachutes billow, carrying them gently down to the mainland below.","created_at":"2020-08-20T07:24:17.570000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745906037357281281","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827207818117144","content":"Web is crying.","created_at":"2020-08-20T07:24:24.883000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745906068030488636","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827207818117144","content":"They stand up from the edge once all the spiders have gone. Only a few remain on their person. The several hundred spiders fill the air like pollen. Brilliant blacks, greens, and silvers against the night sky. Web drops concentration on *Wind Wall*, though they are still cloaked in shadows (double concentration from fez).","created_at":"2020-08-20T07:26:46.845000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745906663462010901","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
